  "readme": "# Scout anti-convergence ordinary full16\n\nThe fresh run passed all 16 ordinary two-client lifecycle checks: realm 1792971063764-c4c81284, protocol run 1792971074413-d1b0416a, with **349 ordinary sent commands**. The first shared-drop attempt failed to produce loot and was retained; the second attempt succeeded. This is a new result, separate from the historical 351 and 341 command runs.\n\nBackend build c743122af05faca43d9535d8c6c2a4bfb01b924f, its 50 inputs/09081 aggregate and immutable dae1 Release are reused. Current driver and execution commit are 4fb58ade4aa95b677bb795625d01da542a84a3f7. The six ordinary protocol drivers and 16 assertions are separate from the nine-input Node regression, whose actual 226 tests passed. No Rust rebuild or new backend Release is claimed.\n\nNormal exit was 0; all six counters were zero before and after, and Root separately observed PID 57640 absent and both owned ports free. The ordinary run retained its 900-second total limit. This archive does not independently replay a per-request 900ms attack deadline, certify capacity, prove a 25-player improvement, or establish GUI/P0/P2 acceptance.\n\n- [Report](public/1792971074413-d1b0416a.report.json), [owned realm](public/1792971063764-c4c81284.realm-evidence.json), [independent audit](public/1792971063764-c4c81284.independent-audit.json), [source proof](public/1792971063764-c4c81284.source-manifest-verification.json), [Zone metrics](public/1792971063764-c4c81284.zone-metrics.json).\n- [Paired trace A](public/1792971074413-d1b0416a-a.trace.jsonl), [paired trace B](public/1792971074413-d1b0416a-b.trace.jsonl), [relogin 0](public/1792971074413-d1b0416a-relogin-0.trace.jsonl), [relogin 1](public/1792971074413-d1b0416a-relogin-1.trace.jsonl), [new-character guard](public/1792971074413-d1b0416a-guard-newCharacter.trace.jsonl), [start-game guard](public/1792971074413-d1b0416a-guard-startGame.trace.jsonl). These are already-audited public traces; the archive copier hashes and copies bytes without parsing or replaying them.\n- [Current preparation](preparation/template-prepared-v2.json), [actual binding derivation](preparation/actual-J-binding-derivation-v2.json), [Root final launcher binding](preparation/launcher-final-binding-v1.json), [prepared-source review](review/full-lifecycle-scout-anti-convergence-independent-review-v1.json), [actual facts review](review/scout-anti-convergence-full16-actual-independent-facts-v1.json). The preserved preparation README remains its original PENDING history.\n- [Actual prerequisite](full16-actual-prerequisite-v1.json), [Root OS cleanup](execution/scout-anti-convergence-full16-root-independent-cleanup-v1.json), [Node226 receipt](source/root-full-driver-receipt-v1.json), [current freeze](source/capacity-scout-anti-convergence-driver-frozen-v1.json), [actual read-only runtime guard](source/runtime/scout-anti-convergence-runtime-readonly-guard-stdout-v1.log), [Node change validation](../capacity-scout-anti-convergence-driver-v1/README.md).\n\nOnly the explicit closed public/source/evidence whitelist is copied. Private stores, credentials, binary payloads, recordings, capacity raw and future Probe19 results are excluded.\n"
